title: The Sith Lord Revealed
subtitle: Someone has learned the truth.
tags: event
view-if: finale and not gambit and finale_day >= 4 and not truth_seen
max-visits: 1
priority: 10
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_shadow.svg
on-arrival: {!
Q.truth_seen = 1;
if (Q.sith_named || Q.dooku_turned) { Q.sidious_known = 1; Q.known_by = 'caucus'; }
// as in the film, Anakin goes to Windu however far he has slid, unless he already went over to Palpatine when the Caucus told him
else if (Q.anakin_found && !Q.hunt_anakin_turned) { Q.sidious_known = 1; Q.known_by = 'anakin'; Q.anakin_fall += 0.5; }
else { Q.sidious_known = 0; Q.known_by = 'none'; }
!}

= The Sith Lord Revealed

[? if known_by = "caucus" : The Caucus's evidence is complete. Bail Organa takes it to Master Windu in person. [? if dooku_turned : With Dooku's testimony, there can be no doubt. ?] **Supreme Chancellor Palpatine is the Sith Lord Darth Sidious.** For once, the Jedi and the Senate know it at the same moment. ?][? if known_by = "anakin" : In a private box at the Galaxies Opera House, the Chancellor tells Anakin Skywalker a story about a Sith Lord who could save the ones he loved from dying. A few days later, Palpatine reveals that he is that Sith Lord. Anakin, shaken, goes straight to Master Windu. ?][? if known_by = "none" and hunt_anakin_turned : Anakin Skywalker has known the truth since the Caucus told him, and he has kept it for his new master. Whatever Palpatine has promised him, it is enough. ?][? if known_by = "none" and not hunt_anakin_turned : The Chancellor has told Anakin Skywalker the truth: he is a Sith Lord, and only he can save Padmé from the deaths Anakin has foreseen. Anakin tells no one. ?]
